{"id":"0be375ec387418e3","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-ce-computable-subset.md","title":"无限 c.e. 集合包含无限可计算子集","display":"thm-ce-computable-subset — 无限 c.e. 集合包含无限可计算子集","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-ce-computable-subset","aliases":["20-thm-ce-computable-subset"],"display":"thm-ce-computable-subset — 无限 c.e. 集合包含无限可计算子集","chapter":"2","section":"2.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 2.1.20","source_printed_pages":[27],"source_pdf_pages":[63],"depends_on":["[[20-df-re]]","[[20-df-recursive]]","[[20-thm-injective-ce-listing]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-ce-computable-subset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-ce-computable-subset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ce-computable-subset — 无限 c.e. 集合包含无限可计算子集"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 2.1.20"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>63</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d129a2a28d269042\" href=\"?note=d129a2a28d269042\" title=\"20-thm-injective-ce-listing\">20-thm-injective-ce-listing</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal E\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal E\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|=\\omega\">\\(|A|=\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d129a2a28d269042\" href=\"?note=d129a2a28d269042\" title=\"20-thm-injective-ce-listing\">20-thm-injective-ce-listing</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ce\\text{-}computable\\text{-}subset}\\vdash\n\\exists B\\in\\mathcal R\\ [B\\subseteq A\\land |B|=\\omega].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ce\\text{-}computable\\text{-}subset}\\vdash\n\\exists B\\in\\mathcal R\\ [B\\subseteq A\\land |B|=\\omega].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>先取任一单射全枚举 f；定义 b₀=f(0)，b_{n+1} 为此枚举中首次大于 b_n 的成员。无限自然数集合无界，故 b 是全可计算且严格递增。判定 x∈B 时计算 b 直到 b_n≥x 再比较。无需有效得到全部 A 的否定成员。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 2.1.20；印刷页 27；PDF 第 63 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"d6dc5974baa6f8a5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-injective-ce-listing","status":"resolved","id":"d129a2a28d269042","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-injective-ce-listing]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-thm-injective-ce-listing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"d6dc5974baa6f8a5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-thm-injective-ce-listing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-injective-ce-listing","status":"resolved","id":"d129a2a28d269042","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-thm-injective-ce-listing]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"|A|=\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ce\\text{-}computable\\text{-}subset}\\vdash\n\\exists B\\in\\mathcal R\\ [B\\subseteq A\\land |B|=\\omega].","display":true}],"bytes":1288,"backlinks":[{"id":"1272f2abca26252c","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-uniform-fixedpoint-compiler]]；see [[20-lem-padding]]；see [[20-thm-ce-computable-subset]]。"}],"outgoing":["60af447f5d59a8dc","d6dc5974baa6f8a5","d129a2a28d269042"]}